  <item><title>usefulwaves 0.0.34</title><description>- Prevent a late audio configuration notice from restarting a healthy microphone during dictation.
- Center dictation recovery actions and shorten warning copy to fit both overlay sizes.
- Group the microphone test, sound preview, volume, and playback device in Dictation settings.
- Request low reasoning for dictation and Quick Actions. Request medium reasoning for meeting analysis and QA summaries.
